    "updated_at": "2017-04-20T15:47:19Z",
    "body": "In Gecko history is in fact associated with the Window.\r\n\r\nIt doesn't matter too hugely much in practice, because the History always represents the entire browsing context tree anyway, right?  We _could_ put it on the Document, but that's a bit weird given that the getter for it is on the Window...",
